id=s20tuner_boot
name=S20 Tuner - Boot Persistence
version=v1.0
versionCode=10
author=cameleonnbss
description=Re-applies the S20 Tuner configuration at every boot. Reads /data/adb/s20tuner/boot.sh generated by the S20 Tuner app (CPU/GPU/RAM/display tuning for Galaxy S20 x1s/y2s). Install the app, enable "Boot persistence", then flash this module.
